{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this building puzzle platformer, <i>you</i> place the platforms and must then reach the top of your own creations. Help Bob through his career from apprentice to architect by building the tallest structure imaginable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trust me, I'm an engineer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509810/extras/trust_me_small.gif?t=1743442478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engineering degree or not, with your help Bob can prevail!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509810/extras/build_all_small_v3.gif?t=1743442478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each level, you're faced with new challenges and can only use a finite number of objects. Twist and turn the objects to make them fit where you want and ultimately create a climbable structure that takes you to the top. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Climb</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509810/extras/climb_all_small_v2.gif?t=1743442478\" />There are many different types of objects to build with and they interact with each other in different ways.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>After each level you will be able to compare your score with all who beat the level before you, can you get the top score?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gold Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3509810/cd3aa1e178a0021832b7059b80cfa8e257ad0ab7.jpg"},{"name":"You're Golden!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3509810/8ad2491c7be4c360d43c3bc1a723165617f3327e.jpg"},{"name":"Demo Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3509810/49f6c1582816d2abe9982b1fd43a3a5ddf2a8156.jpg"},{"name":"Become an Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3509810/940e8ee6964ccb18b03a3aecae9494886f7f58d8.jpg"},{"name":"Become an Engineer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3509810/a20adcd98f2cbb47b7422c279dd2b3c716f41174.jpg"},{"name":"New on the Job","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3509810/77469e92957aadd0c1fa34f2da0320b45a78842c.jpg"},{"name":"Five Gold Stars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3509810/e8401578aaba86fb541024a7c928a0058c4b5280.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3509810?t=1743442478","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3509810?t=1743442478","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509810/ead1f5d2a8e03cb49ab7165e655a84d82f45cb44/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743442478","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509810/ead1f5d2a8e03cb49ab7165e655a84d82f45cb44/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743442478","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this building puzzle platformer, <i>you</i> place the platforms and must then reach the top of your own creations. Help Bob through his career from apprentice to architect by building the tallest structure imaginable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Trust me, I'm an engineer!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509810/extras/trust_me_small.gif?t=1743442478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engineering degree or not, with your help Bob can prevail!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509810/extras/build_all_small_v3.gif?t=1743442478\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each level, you're faced with new challenges and can only use a finite number of objects. Twist and turn the objects to make them fit where you want and ultimately create a climbable structure that takes you to the top. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Climb</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509810/extras/climb_all_small_v2.gif?t=1743442478\" />There are many different types of objects to build with and they interact with each other in different ways.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>After each level you will be able to compare your score with all who beat the level before you, can you get the top score?</p>","developers":["Alexander Lahti","Suumpmolk","Mr_Musicguy","The LoFi Boi"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3215120","name":"Blueprint Bob"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3509810/15c6fde05d98b6e01bf41cb2192c6dd4b30915bd/header.jpg?t=1743442478","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 250 MB ava